\end{align*}
The first term above is at most $1$. For the second term, writing 
\[W^{x,z}_{a,b} = \big(\hat{Q}^{x, z }_{a,b}- \hat{M}^{(\Point,Z),z}_{b}\hat{M}^{(\Point,X),x}_{a}\big)\]
